I acknowledge the use of generative artificial intelligence (AI) tools in the conduct of my research. Details are as follows:

- *Tools used:* Name of tool and version, Vendor, Inc.
- *Purpose of use:* language editing/proofreading, optimizing and debugging scripts of experiment and analysis

All outputs generated by the AI tools were reviewed, verified, and edited by the author as necessary. These tools were not used to fabricate data, generate research results, or create original scientific ideas presented in this manuscript.
